Subject: [PATCH 24/39] Fix Host Performance VB columns: split week VB vs
 monthly progress bar

- weekVb = VB earned this period only (current monthly_valid_bet - previous)
- monthVb = running monthly total used for tier upgrade progress bar
- TierBar now shows: Monthly total, this-week contribution, remaining to upgrade
- Sort by 'Week VB' and 'Monthly VB' split into separate sort options
- Excel export includes both week VB and monthly running total columns

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
